---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer id="studio" class="mt-32 py-24" style="border-top: 2px solid var(--pastel-yellow); background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--base) 0%, var(--pastel-yellow) 100%);">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-screen-xl grid-cols-1 gap-12 px-6 md:grid-cols-3">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="font-serif text-lg italic tracking-tight" style="color: var(--ink);">Saudade</div>
      <p class="max-w-[30ch] text-sm leading-relaxed" style="color: var(--faded);">
        Encuentros en el Camino. Una pequeña librería con un encanto suyo.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--ink);">Categorías</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="/categoria/ropa/" class="transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-1" style="color: var(--faded);">Ropa</a></li>
        <li><a href="/categoria/complementos/" class="transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-1" style="color: var(--faded);">Complementos</a></li>
        <li><a href="/categoria/hogar/" class="transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-1" style="color: var(--faded);">Hogar</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-widest" style="color: var(--ink);">Síguenos</h2>
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-sm">
        <li><a href="https://www.instagram.com/" class="transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-1" style="color: var(--faded);">Instagram</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about" class="transition-all duration-300 hover:translate-x-1" style="color: var(--faded);">Nuestra historia</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-screen-xl px-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]" style="color: var(--faded);">
    © {year} Saudade — Encuentros en el Camino.
  </div>
</footer>
